<title>USA: NAL Financial completes public offering.</title>
<headline>NAL Financial completes public offering.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>NAL Financial Group Inc said Monday that it completed its public offering of 2.5 million common shares at $7.50 per share.</p>
<p>The automobile finance company said it offered all the shares.</p>
<p>The offering was lead managed by Prudential Securities Inc and co-managed by Piper Jaffray Inc and Sands Brothers &amp; Co Ltd, NAL said.</p>
